{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taker your time, relax, and join Mimi on her new feline adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimi has lost her favorite ball and now depends on you to bring the fun back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from your mistakes, retrace your steps if needed, and find the best way to guide her to her ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mimi can get distracted by other things or even wet her little paws \u2014 but it\u2019s all for one reason: to play with her beloved ball again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you\u2019ll find:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665 60 cozy puzzle levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665 Intuitive and relaxing gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665 Achievements to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2665 An adorable kitty that will steal your heart</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119480?t=1761707224","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119480?t=1761707224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/c67a6908620585dec048a862c6df6739bd2fdf76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761707224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119480/c67a6908620585dec048a862c6df6739bd2fdf76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761707224","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"